{"post_stream": {"posts": [{"id": 129092, "name": "Thomas Lynema", "username": "lyz", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/l/aad0ee/{size}.png", "created_at": "2020-05-24T16:50:45.706Z", "cooked": "<p>Changes to the tree and restarts were are taking effect.</p>\n<p>The root cause of this may be this:</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/original/3X/d/c/dcd27e3ba6e42012d673440424151de603c2fac9.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/vvu1pX7HE33gQtZmxsNniZt5LVT.png?dl=1\" title=\"e55b909189c84759af6a8a8ab1f50eaf80be031e.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/optimized/3X/d/c/dcd27e3ba6e42012d673440424151de603c2fac9_2_690x42.png\" alt=\"e55b909189c84759af6a8a8ab1f50eaf80be031e.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"vvu1pX7HE33gQtZmxsNniZt5LVT\" width=\"690\" height=\"42\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/optimized/3X/d/c/dcd27e3ba6e42012d673440424151de603c2fac9_2_690x42.png, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/optimized/3X/d/c/dcd27e3ba6e42012d673440424151de603c2fac9_2_1035x63.png 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/optimized/3X/d/c/dcd27e3ba6e42012d673440424151de603c2fac9_2_1380x84.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"5E3A3C\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">e55b909189c84759af6a8a8ab1f50eaf80be031e.png</span><span class=\"informations\">1483×92 16.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>The .1 location doesn’t exist anymore.  There are two .0 locations.  I’m wondering if this was due to upgrading to Fedora 32.</p>\n<p>Probably relevant is that I had this issue from running livefs <a href=\"https://jlelse.blog/dev/fix-broken-silverblue/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://jlelse.blog/dev/fix-broken-silverblue/</a> .  The livefs command was run after a few update failures to test and see if that would work.</p>\n<p>After looking at grub configs, this bug still exists as well <a href=\"https://github.com/ostreedev/ostree/issues/1009\" class=\"inline-onebox\">grub2-mkconfig when invoked directly generates bad config on EFI · Issue #1009 · ostreedev/ostree · GitHub</a> .  That seems unlikely to be related.   Still, it isn’t clear if the /boot/loader/entries are correct.  There is only one entry in that directory now, ostree-2-fedora-atomic.conf.  For whatever reason, there is another one created in the /boot/efi/EFI/fedora/grub.cfg file that also points to the :0 image.</p>\n<p>I could manually perform filesystem operations to make the dirs, but don’t know if that is the correct way to go.  Does ostree have a clean way to fix this?</p>", "post_number": 1, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 10, "updated_at": "2023-06-22T20:05:57.181Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 938, "reads": 31, "readers_count": 30, "score": 4696.2, "yours": false, "topic_id": 77984, "topic_slug": "silverblue-missing-boot-option", "display_username": "Thomas Lynema", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 6, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://jlelse.blog/dev/fix-broken-silverblue/", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "Fix Fedora Silverblue after \"rpm-ostree ex livefs\" failed - jlelse's Blog", "clicks": 8}, {"url": "https://github.com/ostreedev/ostree/issues/1009", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "grub2-mkconfig when invoked directly generates bad config on EFI · Issue #1009 · ostreedev/ostree · GitHub", "clicks": 4}, {"url": "https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/original/3X/d/c/dcd27e3ba6e42012d673440424151de603c2fac9.png", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "dcd27e3ba6e42012d673440424151de603c2fac9.png", "clicks": 0}], "read": true, "user_title": null, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 10820, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 0, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/silverblue-missing-boot-option/77984/1", "event": null, "calendar_details": [], "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 180679, "name": "Thomas Lynema", "username": "lyz", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/l/aad0ee/{size}.png", "created_at": "2020-05-24T18:03:40.904Z", "cooked": "<p>A bit more detail.  The system is hitting this issue <a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Common_F31_bugs#On_Fedora_Silverblue.2FIoT.2C_the_GRUB_menu_shows_duplicate_entries\" class=\"inline-onebox\">Common F31 bugs - Fedora Project Wiki</a> .  Also, when performing an install<br>\nrpm-ostree install fuse-exfat exfat-utils<br>\nThe result is that no new kernels are added to /boot/ostree and no entry is added in grub.<br>\nThis may be a twisted manifestation of the issues discussed here <a href=\"https://discussion.fedoraproject.org/t/boot-entries-gone-after-upgrade/8026\" class=\"inline-onebox\">Boot entries gone after upgrade</a> .  Many of the people on that thread ended up reinstalling.</p>", "post_number": 2, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 10, "updated_at": "2023-03-08T07:55:02.511Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 12, "reads": 28, "readers_count": 27, "score": 65.6, "yours": false, "topic_id": 77984, "topic_slug": "silverblue-missing-boot-option", "display_username": "Thomas Lynema", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://discussion.fedoraproject.org/t/boot-entries-gone-after-upgrade/8026", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "Boot entries gone after upgrade - Silverblue - Fedora Discussion", "clicks": 7}, {"url": "https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Common_F31_bugs#On_Fedora_Silverblue.2FIoT.2C_the_GRUB_menu_shows_duplicate_entries", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "Common F31 bugs - Fedora Project Wiki", "clicks": 7}], "read": true, "user_title": null, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 10820, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 0, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/silverblue-missing-boot-option/77984/2", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 144640, "name": "Thomas Lynema", "username": "lyz", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/l/aad0ee/{size}.png", "created_at": "2020-05-27T16:08:04.060Z", "cooked": "<p>Tried disabling selinux due to this message in the journal:</p>\n<pre><code>May 27 11:42:46 audit[43320]: AVC avc:  denied  { nnp_transition nosuid_transition } for  pid=43320 comm=\"dracut\" scontext=system_u:system_r:install_t\n</code></pre>\n<p>Performed some updates:</p>\n<pre><code>State: idle\nDeployments:\n  ostree://fedora:fedora/32/x86_64/silverblue\n                   Version: 32.20200527.0 (2020-05-27T03:48:57Z)\n                BaseCommit: f4d503fdd5382ba0efca2379b7c25ec42e8e6eba13cfcaae8dd0eaec44afbc53\n              GPGSignature: Valid signature by 97A1AE57C3A2372CCA3A4ABA6C13026D12C944D0\n                      Diff: 33 upgraded, 2 added\n</code></pre>\n<p>But /boot/ostree only has the old image.  No new location for the initramfs nor the kernel image are made.</p>\n<pre><code>find / -name vmlinuz*64\n/boot/ostree/fedora-atomic-4ca22d3cc75ddd335c7d06d5cbe84676a1b27c561421eaceb9a0bc201288f322/vmlinuz-5.6.13-300.fc32.x86_64\n</code></pre>\n<p>The journal says an initrd was attempted</p>\n<pre><code>May 27 11:42:46 rpm-ostree[28985]: dracut: *** Creating initramfs image file '/tmp/initramfs.img' &gt;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Going to try to manually build the grub entries and copy files from</p>\n<pre><code>/sysroot/ostree/deploy/fedora-atomic/deploy/b6dfd326fa076abead91e2a3b2ac2062754516e33c831e7c88e75cb223edf083.0/usr/lib/modules/5.6.14-300.fc32.x86_64/\n</code></pre>", "post_number": 3, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 10, "updated_at": "2023-03-08T07:41:02.260Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 15, "reads": 28, "readers_count": 27, "score": 85.6, "yours": false, "topic_id": 77984, "topic_slug": "silverblue-missing-boot-option", "display_username": "Thomas Lynema", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 10820, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 0, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/silverblue-missing-boot-option/77984/3", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 189981, "name": "Thomas Lynema", "username": "lyz", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/l/aad0ee/{size}.png", "created_at": "2020-05-27T16:41:09.552Z", "cooked": "<p>Created the boot entry manually.  System somewhat booted, but most services were unable to start journalctl didn’t log anything.</p>\n<pre><code>[lyz@bubu ~]$ cat /boot/loader.0/entries/ostree-1-fedora-atomic.conf\ntitle Fedora 32.20200524.0 (Silverblue) (ostree:1)\nversion 2\noptions resume=/dev/mapper/fedora-swap rd.lvm.lv=fedora/root rd.lvm.lv=fedora/swap root=/dev/mapper/fedora-root consoleblank=600 pcie_aspm=off quiet amd_iommu=on video=efifb:off rd.driver.pre=vfio-pci  vfio-pci.ids=10de:1c03,10de:10f1,1022:145f ostree=/ostree/boot.0/fedora-atomic/b6dfd326fa076abead91e2a3b2ac2062754516e33c831e7c88e75cb223edf083/0\nlinux /ostree/fedora-atomic-b6dfd326fa076abead91e2a3b2ac2062754516e33c831e7c88e75cb223edf083/vmlinuz-5.6.14-300.fc32.x86_64\ninitrd /ostree/fedora-atomic-b6dfd326fa076abead91e2a3b2ac2062754516e33c831e7c88e75cb223edf083/initramfs-5.6.14-300.fc32.x86_64.img\n</code></pre>\n<p>This is what the files on the non-booting revision look like.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/original/3X/5/6/567a61a7ac89218545f7b479cba8ab2a9f4a7b83.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/cl1gl2nZh3CHBsCn8ed6CxVkoQX.png?dl=1\" title=\"9a44139404ae94b89a1cc820764745290ecbc88c.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/original/3X/5/6/567a61a7ac89218545f7b479cba8ab2a9f4a7b83.png\" alt=\"9a44139404ae94b89a1cc820764745290ecbc88c.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"cl1gl2nZh3CHBsCn8ed6CxVkoQX\" width=\"690\" height=\"461\" data-dominant-color=\"433E3E\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">9a44139404ae94b89a1cc820764745290ecbc88c.png</span><span class=\"informations\">903×604 80 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>", "post_number": 4, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 10, "updated_at": "2023-03-09T06:59:48.774Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": 3, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 6, "reads": 24, "readers_count": 23, "score": 34.8, "yours": false, "topic_id": 77984, "topic_slug": "silverblue-missing-boot-option", "display_username": "Thomas Lynema", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 3, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/original/3X/5/6/567a61a7ac89218545f7b479cba8ab2a9f4a7b83.png", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "567a61a7ac89218545f7b479cba8ab2a9f4a7b83.png", "clicks": 0}], "read": true, "user_title": null, "reply_to_user": {"id": 10820, "username": "lyz", "name": "Thomas Lynema", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/l/aad0ee/{size}.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 10820, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 0, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/silverblue-missing-boot-option/77984/4", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 161851, "name": "Thomas Lynema", "username": "lyz", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/l/aad0ee/{size}.png", "created_at": "2020-05-27T21:21:49.274Z", "cooked": "<p>Everything mentioned in the previous posts is normal.  I tested this on a VM.  The issue was that the finalization process was failing with</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>May 27 16:46:34 ostree[44286]: error: Unexpected state: /run/ostree-booted found, but no /boot/loader<br>\ndirectory<br>\nMay 27 16:46:34 systemd[1]: ostree-finalize-staged.service: Control process exited, code=exited, stat<br>\nus=1/FAILURE<br>\nMay 27 16:46:34 systemd[1]: ostree-finalize-staged.service: Failed with result ‘exit-code’.<br>\nMay 27 16:46:34 systemd[1]: Stopped OSTree Finalize Staged Deployment.<br>\nMay 27 16:46:34 audit[1]: SERVICE_STOP pid=1 uid=0 auid=4294967295 ses=4294967295 subj=system_u:system_r:init_t:s0 msg=‘unit=ostree-finalize-staged comm=“systemd” exe=“/usr/lib/systemd/systemd” hostname=? addr=? terminal=? res=failed’</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>After reading this discussion, I ran finalize manually and it worked</p>\n<aside class=\"quote quote-modified\" data-post=\"11\" data-topic=\"12866\">\n  <div class=\"title\">\n    <div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/g/f5a326/48.png\" class=\"avatar\">\n    <a href=\"https://discussion.fedoraproject.org/t/my-silverbox-os-no-longer-updates-probably-due-to-an-error-with-grub2-mkconfig/12866/11\">My Silverbox OS no longer updates, probably due to an error with grub2-mkconfig (?)</a> <a class=\"badge-category__wrapper \" href=\"/c/project/7\"><span data-category-id=\"7\" data-drop-close=\"true\" class=\"badge-category \" title=\"Discuss any aspect of the Fedora Project here! This space is organized by tag, and each tag corresponds to a Fedora Project Team (including Special Interest Groups and Working Groups). See the high-level #mindshare and #engineering tags for broad topics.\"><span class=\"badge-category__name\">Project Discussion</span></span></a>\n  </div>\n  <blockquote>\n    Its still broken for me. I did a “rpm-ostree install gnome-tweaks” and after a reboot it seems as i had never done that. \nSo i did it again and the result is: \nState: idle\nAutomaticUpdates: disabled\nDeployments:\n  ostree://fedora:fedora/31/x86_64/silverblue\n                   Version: 31.20191211.0 (2019-12-11T01:41:34Z)\n                BaseCommit: 500e1a1bd0c3a5d1e98857852ad1fce56ab476a95923fb765ad3ce276d8af780\n              GPGSignature: Valid signature by 7D22D5867F2A4236474BF7B850CB390B3C335…\n  </blockquote>\n</aside>\n\n<p>So the issue is /boot being unmounted about 10 seconds before the ostree-finalize-staged service is run.</p>\n<p>May 27 16:46:24 systemd[1]: boot.mount: Succeeded.<br>\nMay 27 16:46:24 systemd[1]: Unmounted /boot.</p>\n<p>The bug is somewhere in the ostree-finalize-staged.service file.  Maybe RequireMountsFor=/boot would work?</p>", "post_number": 5, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 10, "updated_at": "2023-03-08T07:47:36.845Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 27, "reads": 23, "readers_count": 22, "score": 144.6, "yours": false, "topic_id": 77984, "topic_slug": "silverblue-missing-boot-option", "display_username": "Thomas Lynema", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 4, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://discussion.fedoraproject.org/t/my-silverbox-os-no-longer-updates-probably-due-to-an-error-with-grub2-mkconfig/12866/11", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "My Silverbox OS no longer updates, probably due to an error with grub2-mkconfig (?) - Silverblue - Fedora Discussion", "clicks": 3}], "read": true, "user_title": null, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 10820, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 0, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/silverblue-missing-boot-option/77984/5", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 159655, "name": "Colin Walters", "username": "walters", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/walters/{size}/25_2.png", "created_at": "2020-05-27T23:55:34.183Z", "cooked": "<blockquote>\n<p>Maybe RequireMountsFor=/boot would work?</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>We actually <a href=\"https://github.com/ostreedev/ostree/pull/2098\">just did that</a>.</p>\n<p>What’s in your <code>/etc/fstab</code>?  Or <code>systemctl status boot.mount</code>?</p>", "post_number": 6, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 10, "updated_at": "2023-03-08T07:46:45.450Z", "reply_count": 2, "reply_to_post_number": 5, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 1, "reads": 23, "readers_count": 22, "score": 19.6, "yours": false, "topic_id": 77984, "topic_slug": "silverblue-missing-boot-option", "display_username": "Colin Walters", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://github.com/ostreedev/ostree/pull/2098", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "finalize: Add RequiresMountsFor=/boot too by cgwalters · Pull Request #2098 · ostreedev/ostree · GitHub", "clicks": 6}], "read": true, "user_title": "Packaging Team", "title_is_group": false, "reply_to_user": {"id": 10820, "username": "lyz", "name": "Thomas Lynema", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/l/aad0ee/{size}.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 23, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 2, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/silverblue-missing-boot-option/77984/6", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": true, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 172237, "name": "Colin Walters", "username": "walters", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/walters/{size}/25_2.png", "created_at": "2020-05-28T00:01:30.611Z", "cooked": "<p>To elaborate, you can use e.g.<br>\n<code>systemctl edit ostree-finalize-staged.service</code><br>\nand then paste in:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">[Unit]\nRequiresMountsFor=/boot\n</code></pre>\n<p>to see if that helps.</p>", "post_number": 7, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 10, "updated_at": "2020-05-28T11:26:45.579Z", "reply_count": 2, "reply_to_post_number": 6, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 1, "reads": 23, "readers_count": 22, "score": 19.6, "yours": false, "topic_id": 77984, "topic_slug": "silverblue-missing-boot-option", "display_username": "Colin Walters", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "Packaging Team", "title_is_group": false, "reply_to_user": {"id": 3156, "username": "qoheniac", "name": "qoheniac", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/q/db3279/{size}.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 23, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 2, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/silverblue-missing-boot-option/77984/7", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 180696, "name": "Thomas Lynema", "username": "lyz", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/l/aad0ee/{size}.png", "created_at": "2020-05-28T11:10:52.100Z", "cooked": "<p>fstab</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>/dev/mapper/fedora-root /                       xfs     defaults        0 0<br>\nUUID=41120299-9366-4262-9aef-3f7ab527045b /boot                   ext4    defaults        1 2<br>\nUUID=C69B-3D18          /boot/efi               vfat    umask=0077,shortname=winnt 0 2<br>\n/dev/mapper/fedora-swap swap                    swap    defaults        0 0<br>\nUUID=2136271a-d069-4ee8-a7d0-fdf114eed5cb /home/media ext4\tdefaults\t0 0<br>\nUUID=1C5D-FD94 /var/lib/docker/volumes/plex exfat\tdefaults\t0 0</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>systemctl status boot.mount</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>● boot.mount - /boot<br>\nLoaded: loaded (/etc/fstab; generated)<br>\nActive: active (mounted) since Wed 2020-05-27 16:47:11 EDT; 14h ago<br>\nWhere: /boot<br>\nWhat: /dev/sdb2<br>\nDocs: man:fstab(5)<br>\nman:systemd-fstab-generator(8)<br>\nTasks: 0 (limit: 38356)<br>\nMemory: 176.0K<br>\nCPU: 11ms<br>\nCGroup: /system.slice/boot.mount<br>\nWarning: some journal files were not opened due to insufficient permissions.</p>\n</blockquote>", "post_number": 8, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 10, "updated_at": "2023-03-08T07:55:02.928Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": 6, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 4, "reads": 20, "readers_count": 19, "score": 24.0, "yours": false, "topic_id": 77984, "topic_slug": "silverblue-missing-boot-option", "display_username": "Thomas Lynema", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "reply_to_user": {"id": 3156, "username": "qoheniac", "name": "qoheniac", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/q/db3279/{size}.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 10820, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 0, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/silverblue-missing-boot-option/77984/8", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 194300, "name": "Thomas Lynema", "username": "lyz", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/l/aad0ee/{size}.png", "created_at": "2020-05-28T11:25:48.115Z", "cooked": "<p>Ok, performed the update of the service and updated with systemctl daemon-reload</p>\n<p>Looks promising</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>[root@bubu lyz]# systemctl list-dependencies ostree-finalize-staged.service<br>\nostree-finalize-staged.service<br>\n● ├─-.mount<br>\n● ├─boot.mount<br>\n● └─system.slice</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Staged this change:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>ostree://fedora:fedora/32/x86_64/silverblue<br>\nVersion: 32.20200528.0 (2020-05-28T01:22:03Z)<br>\nBaseCommit: 0574a6a0da357c4ebade7b07455726eb8295e1b92526cf45bdff613157768871<br>\nGPGSignature: Valid signature by 97A1AE57C3A2372CCA3A4ABA6C13026D12C944D0<br>\nDiff: 2 upgraded, 1 removed</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Hurray!</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>[lyz@bubu ~]$ rpm-ostree status<br>\nState: idle<br>\nDeployments:<br>\n● ostree://fedora:fedora/32/x86_64/silverblue<br>\nVersion: 32.20200528.0 (2020-05-28T01:22:03Z)</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Log</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>May 28 07:20:22 systemd[1]: Stopped OSTree Finalize Staged Deployment.<br>\nMay 28 07:20:22 systemd[1]: ostree-finalize-staged.service: Consumed 7.880s CPU time.<br>\nMay 28 07:20:22 systemd[1]: Stopped target Local File Systems.<br>\nMay 28 07:20:22 kernel: audit: type=1131 audit(1590664822.794:782): pid=1 uid=0 auid=4294967295 ses=4294967<br>\n295 subj=system_u:system_r:init_t:s0 msg=‘unit=ostree-finalize-staged comm=“systemd” exe=“/usr/lib/systemd/systemd” hostnam<br>\ne=? addr=? terminal=? res=success’<br>\n…<br>\nMay 28 07:20:22 systemd[1]: Unmounting /boot…</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>So yeah, that fixes it.  Thanks much.</p>", "post_number": 9, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 10, "updated_at": "2023-03-08T08:00:35.088Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": 7, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 2, "reads": 18, "readers_count": 17, "score": 13.6, "yours": false, "topic_id": 77984, "topic_slug": "silverblue-missing-boot-option", "display_username": "Thomas Lynema", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "reply_to_user": {"id": 3156, "username": "qoheniac", "name": "qoheniac", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/q/db3279/{size}.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 10820, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 0, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/silverblue-missing-boot-option/77984/9", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 120070, "name": "Thomas Lynema", "username": "lyz", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/l/aad0ee/{size}.png", "created_at": "2020-05-28T11:32:18.215Z", "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"walters\" data-post=\"7\" data-topic=\"77984\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://sea1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/walters/48/25_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> walters:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">[Unit]\nRequiresMountsFor=/boot\n</code></pre>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Does this stack, or should it be</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>[Unit]<br>\nRequiresMountsFor=/sysroot /boot</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>The dependency tree is the same either way.</p>", "post_number": 10, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 10, "updated_at": "2023-03-08T22:33:59.662Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": 7, "quote_count": 1, "incoming_link_count": 0, "reads": 14, "readers_count": 13, "score": 2.8, "yours": false, "topic_id": 77984, "topic_slug": "silverblue-missing-boot-option", "display_username": "Thomas Lynema", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name":